"lily-of-the-valley" and "lilies-of-the-valley" are nouns.
The noun "lilies-of-the-valley" is the plural form of the noun "lily-of-the-valley".

A tree, a flower, a mushroom and a crop are plants.
A birch, a spruce and a pine are trees.
An archipelago, a dandelion, a lily-of-the-valley are flowers.

